# R4: the BUILD CONTEXT root must have one — this repo root IS the context.
# R5: secret patterns use the `**/` form. A bare `.env` matches ONLY the context
# root, so nested copies still ship; measured in meshmarket, where the bare form
# put .env.local into /app.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/secrets.env
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/id_rsa
**/client_secret*.json

# Not secrets, just weight and noise.
**/node_modules
.git
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log
